{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116843","id":3335603654,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7G0UXG","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116843","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116843.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116843.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116843","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116843/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116843/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116843/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/a3499cf72a49ed4af82096d6105ddd06aa471f46","number":116843,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix Dictionary editor losing selection when changing types in Remote inspector","user":{"login":"Mrfanta-stick","id":105064999,"node_id":"U_kgDOBkMqJw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105064999?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick","html_url":"https://github.com/Mrfanta-stick","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #116748\r\n\r\n**Description:**\r\nIn the Remote inspector, the `EditorPropertyDictionary` continuously polls and calls `update_property()` to sync with the running game state. \r\n\r\nIf a user attempts to change the type of a dictionary key or value using the `EditorVariantTypePopupMenu` (the pencil icon), the asynchronous polling loop evaluates the `changing_type_index == slot.index` condition. Prior to this fix, the poll would prematurely reset `changing_type_index` to `EditorPropertyDictionaryObject::NOT_CHANGING_TYPE` and steal focus while the popup menu was still actively open. \r\n\r\nWhen the user finally made a selection, the callback would fire against a cleared index, throwing the error: `Tried to change the type of a dict key or value, but nothing was selected.`\r\n\r\n**The Fix:**\r\nAdded a visibility state guard (`&& (!change_type || !change_type->is_visible())`) to the focus-grabbing and state-reset block at the end of `update_property()`. This prevents the polling loop from resetting the target index while the type-selection popup is actively open, safely preserving the state until the user completes their selection and the menu closes.\r\n\r\n**Testing:**\r\n- Verified on `master` that changing dictionary key/value types via the pencil icon in the Remote inspector no longer throws an error and successfully applies the newly selected type.\r\n- Verified that local inspector behavior remains unaffected and correctly grabs focus after a type change.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","description":"","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","number":24,"state":"closed","title":"4.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2535,"created_at":"2025-11-27T20:29:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T18:39:31Z","closed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z","due_on":null},"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-02-27T12:47:27Z","updated_at":"2026-04-23T13:40:57Z","closed_at":"2026-04-23T13:40:50Z","merged_at":"2026-04-23T13:40:50Z","merge_commit_sha":"a712b7acc3e09ec667428f2245081ddb455d94a7","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"Mrfanta-stick:fix-remote-